Call them slobs. Call them jerks. Call them gross. Just
don't call them when you're in trouble.

2
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:11,000
Police Academy is a comedy, crime film directed by Hugh Wilson.

3
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:13,500
New rules enforced by the Lady Mayoress mean that sex, weight, height and
intelligence need no longer be a factor for joining the Police Force.

4
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:16,000
This opens the floodgates for all and sundry to enter the Police
Academy, much to the chagrin of the instructors.

5
00:20:12,500 --> 00:20:18,500
Not everyone is there through choice, though.

6
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:21,000
Social misfit Mahoney has been forced to sign up as the only alternative to a jail sentence
and it doesn't take long before he falls foul of the boorish Lieutenant Harris.

7
00:28:17,500 --> 00:28:23,500
But before long, Mahoney realises that he is enjoying being a
police cadet and decides he wants to stay...

8
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:26,000
while Harris decides he wants Mahoney out!

