The film stars Steve Guttenberg, Kim Cattrall and G.

18
01:12:45,000 --> 01:12:51,000
The film was produced by The Ladd Company.

19
01:16:47,500 --> 01:16:53,500
It premiered on March 23, 1984.

20
01:20:50,000 --> 01:20:56,000
It grossed $8.5 million in its opening weekend and more than $149 million worldwide, against a
budget of $4.8 million, and remains the most successful film of the series as of 2022.

21
01:24:52,500 --> 01:24:58,500
The film spawned six sequels in the Police Academy franchise, and is the
only film in the franchise to be rated R by the MPAA.

22
01:28:55,000 --> 01:29:01,000
The film explores themes of trainer, recruit, shenanigan, police academy.

23
01:32:57,500 --> 01:33:03,500
The tone is lighthearted.
